-5a48-9e6b-3973e448e4c7","fields":{"slug":"/llm/moe-architecture/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"MoE는 전문가를 어떻게 고를까","summary":"FFN을 전문가로 나눈 뒤 라우터가 토큰마다 일부만 골라 활성화하는 MoE의 원리를 다룹니다. 게이팅 수식, 전문가 붕괴, 보조 손실 없이 균형 잡는 법, 세분화 전문가까지 핵심 메커니즘을 정리합니다.","date":"2026.09.08.","category":"LLM","series":"llm","seriesOrder":8,"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/ff2cd/thumbnail.png","srcSet":"/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/bcf32/thumbnail.png 750w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/ff2cd/thumbnail.png 768w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/475f8/thumbnail.png 1080w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/85c70/thumbnail.png 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/3225c/thumbnail.avif 750w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/b7b85/thumbnail.avif 768w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/97eec/thumbnail.avif 1080w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/56c83/thumbnail.avif 1200w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/2c6fe/thumbnail.webp 750w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/6571b/thumbnail.webp 768w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/af729/thumbnail.webp 1080w,\n/static/07363d39708993c9d4e563cc6b2f0d75/c895b/thumbnail.webp 1200w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"34cb95f4-b2b1-5190-8e89-ae3ff8244a19","fields":{"slug":"/llm/attention-variants/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"KV Cache를 10분의 1로 줄인 MLA의 트릭","summary":"GQA는 K, V의 벌 수를 줄였고 MLA는 차원 자체를 압축했습니다. 잠재 벡터로 캐시를 10분의 1로 줄이는 메커니즘과 RoPE 흡수 트릭을 짚습니다.","date":"2026.09.14.","category":"LLM","series":"llm","seriesOrder":9,"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"la